      "startMs": 195277,
      "endMs": 204023,
      "evidence": {
        "quote": "Try it yourself, track every euro like I did, and you will be surprised how far the money goes. And that's my trip. Thanks for watching, bye.",
        "critique_and_reasoning": "The outro fails to direct viewers to the designated lead magnet from the brief."
